Package: maxio-phy-dkms
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: dkms (>= 1.95), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Maxio MAE0621A Gigabit Ethernet PHY driver (DKMS)
 Source for the Maxio MAE0621A PHY driver, compiled by DKMS at install
 time against the running kernel (no prebuilt .ko). The MAE0621A is an
 RTL8211F-compatible part used on the Seeed Studio reComputer
 Industrial RK3576 carrier (GMAC1). Basic C22 operation already works
 with the generic driver; this driver additionally programs the RJ45
 LED mode (LED1 = link 10/100/1000, LED2 = activity) and registers the
 same sequence as a PHY fixup against MDIO bind races.
 .
 Kernel headers are required to compile the module.
